# aux-read-aux: Can a formula read an aux quantity by name (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: error
# pc: ODE0051
# ruling: matches. XPPAUT stops with "illegal expression" and writes nothing. This also holds when the name is declared twice as an aux, so a later reference never reaches an aux column.
x'=-x
x(0)=1
aux q=2*x
aux g=q
@ total=1,dt=0.5
